# Business / commercial planning — never in the user-facing OSS repo.
# Strategy, pricing, enterprise, and investor material lives outside this
# repository; these patterns are belt-and-suspenders for stray drafts.
SOLVEPLANE*
EXPANSION*
INDUSTRY_COMPARISON*
